'''2Game Esports''' is a [[:Category:Brazil|Brazilian]] esports organization. The team currently has players competing in ''Street Fighter'', ''Tekken'', ''2XKO'', and ''Mortal Kombat''.

==Timeline==
{{tabs dynamic
|name1=2024
|name2=2025
|name3=2026
|This=3
|content1=
