* August 28th - [[Dragon_Legend]] joins.<ref name="Dragon_Legend joins">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/2GAMEFGC/status/1961194583880319368|title=É com muito orgulho que anunciamos Dragon Legend, jogador de Street Fighter 6 em nossa lineup!|language={{Flag|br}}|publisher='''2Game Esports''' on X|date=2025-08-28}}</ref>
