|content1=
*January 7th - [[Vision Strikers]] are acquired by '''DRX'''. [[Knee]], [[Chanel]] and [[Infested]] all join the organisation.<ref name="DRX VS">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/DRX_VS/status/1479325378225524737|title=A new year. A new season. A new chapter.|date=2022-01-07|publisher=[[DRX]]}}</ref>
|content2=
*June 9th - [[poka]] joins the roster.<ref name="DRX poka">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/DRX_VS/status/1667048886584905730|title=DRX is proud to welcome our newest 2D FGC player @pokachansan! Welcome to the DRX family!|date=2023-06-09|publisher=[[DRX]]}}</ref>
|content3=
