|content1=
*February 23rd - [[ADTerminal]] and [[WireMan]] are drafted by '''Team Vitality''' for [[Gfinity/Elite Series/Season 3|Gfinity Elite Series Season 3]].<ref name="Gfin S3 Draft">{{cite web |url=https://www.gfinity.net/news/details/gfinity-elite-draft-live-blog|title=Gfinity Elite Draft|publisher=Gfinity|date=2018-02-23}}</ref>
*February 27th - '''Team Vitality''' officially enters the FGC with the signings of [[TKR]], [[Linkexelo]], [[JuniorLeo]], and [[ApolloSteed]].<ref name="VITA Roster">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Team_Vitality/status/968577788373553152|title=Welcome to the world of Vitality.. Prepare for battle 👊 We're absolutely delighted to announce our Street Fighter V roster: @TKR_LYON @Linkexelo @JuniorL3o & @ApolloSteedUK #VforVictory Please give them & our @Gfinity draftees @ADTerminal_ & @behindthewires a warm welcome 💛|publisher=[[Team Vitality]] on Twitter|date=2018-02-27}}</ref>
*September 3rd - [[ADTerminal]]'s contract expires.<ref name="ADTerminal leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/ADTerminal_/status/1036585629247856640|title=As of today my contract has ended with @Team_Vitality and I'm now a free agent! Huge thanks my teammates and cohorts @TKR_LYON, @Linkexelo, @JuniorL3o, @ApolloSteedUK, @Gregan25 and @behindthewires 😊🕹️ We had a good time! Where will Gfin S4 take me 🤔|publisher=[[ADTerminal]] on Twitter|date=2018-09-03}}</ref>
*September 5th - [[WireMan]]'s contract expires.<ref name="WireMan leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/behindthewires/status/1037372475275980802|title=My last day with @Team_Vitality 😢 I've had amazing times with them & @Gfinity , they've been great! Very fortunate to spend time with @TKR_LYON @Linkexelo @JuniorL3o @ApolloSteedUK @ADTerminal_ and new FGC recruit @Gregan25 They have a strong Season 4 ahead! #VforVictory 🐝🐍🗻|publisher=[[WireMan]] on Twitter|date=2018-09-05}}</ref>
*September 28th - [[Verdoyance]] and [[Konvy]] are drafted by '''Team Vitality''' for [[Gfinity/Elite Series/Season 4|Gfinity Elite Series Season 4]].<ref name="Gfin S4 Draft">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Gfinity/status/1045736809731424257|title=First choice for @Team_Vitality is the dangerous Blanka main @Verdoyance 👊👊👊 Making the next pick is @Methodgg|publisher=Gfinity on Twitter|date=2018-09-28}} {{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Gfinity/status/1045746148592570369|title=French #SFV player @Konvyy is @Team_Vitality's second pick! Only two more challengers will be selected!|publisher=Gfinity on Twitter|date=2018-09-28}}</ref>
|content2=
*January (approx) - [[Konvy]] leaves the roster.
*January 16th - [[JuniorLéo]] and [[ApolloSteed]] leave the roster.<ref name="JuniorLeo leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/JuniorL3o/status/1085536445199278080|title=My road with @TeamVitality ends today!
It was a huge pleasure to represent them in 2018 for the @Gfinity, CPT and.. RedBull Kumite ! 😎 Now I'm looking forward for 2019 !|publisher=[[JuniorLéo]] on Twitter|date=2019-01-16}}</ref><ref name="ApolloSteed leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/ApolloSteedUK/status/1085604649946828802|title=Been an amazing year with @TeamVitality but today will be my last day with them. Can only thank them for giving me the chance to travel for cpt, play in gfinity and that really handy 3 way charger. And a big thanks to @Vitality_TKR for bringing me in the first place.|publisher=[[ApolloSteed]] on Twitter|date=2019-01-16}}</ref>
*March 4th - [[Hurricane]] joins the roster.<ref name="VIT Hurricane">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/TeamVitality/status/1102623709616111616|title=Our Street Fighter V line-up evolves! 💪 We're indeed extremely happy to welcome @Hurricane_FGC in the family 🐝 He's joining @Vitality_TKR (captain), @Linkexelo & @Verdoyance to complete our 2019 roster #VforVictory|publisher=[[Team Vitality]] on Twitter|date=2019-03-04}}</ref>
*June 1st - [[TKR]], [[Verdoyance]], and [[Linkexelo]] all leave the roster.<ref name="VIT leavings">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/TKResport/status/1134786603728166912|title=Sad to announce that my contract with @TeamVitality ends today.. It was an incredible adventure, you are the best org in the world, I can't thank you enough ❤️ My mission was to win @Gfinity, glad we did it. Now It's very important for me to find another partnership. Please RT 🙏|publisher=[[TKR]] on Twitter|date=2019-06-01}}{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Verdoyance/status/1134791335385468928|title=My contract with @TeamVitality has come to an end I'm thankful for all the opportunities and the good memories, wishing all the best to the vitality crew for their future endeavours !|publisher=[[Verdoyance]] on Twitter|date=2019-06-01}}{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Linkexelo/status/1134795012879847425|title=Today is a sad day as my contract with @TeamVitality comes to an end. I'm so thankful that I could be part of the journey, winning the @Gfinity and competing all around the world. You were my other family 💛 ! Now, I'm looking forward new oppotunities, still eager to compete 👊|publisher=[[Linkexelo]] on Twitter|date=2019-06-01}}</ref>
|content3=
*January 3rd - [[Hurricane]] leaves '''Team Vitality'''; the organization exits the FGC in turn.<ref name="Hurricane leaves">{{cite web |url=https://twitter.com/Hurricane_FGC/status/1213065812807958529|title=It's been an amazing journey of learning and becoming stronger, all good things unfortunately comes to an end. Thank you @TeamVitality and you particularly @Gregan25 for this amazing journey and best of luck in the future! Let's start another chapter !|publisher=[[Hurricane]] on Twitter|date=2020-01-03}}</ref>
|content4=
*April 22nd - '''Team Vitality''' rejoins the FGC with the signing og ''Tekken 8'' player [[Jeondding]].<ref name="VIT Jeondding">{{cite web|url=https://twitter.com/TeamVitality/status/1782348626272116903|title=Are you ready to fight? Welcome @Jeondding_tk 🐝|publisher='''Team Vitality''' on X|date=2024-04-22}}</ref>
*May 28th - '''Team Vitality''' returns to ''Street Fighter'' by signing [[Sayff]] and [[Valmaster]], the latter of which was bought out from [[Team Falcons]].<ref name="VIT SF6">{{cite web|url=https://vitality.gg/en/esports/sf6/|title=TEAM VITALITY ENTERS THE STREET FIGHTER 6 RING WITH PLAYERS SAYFF AND VALMASTER|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2024-05-28}}</ref>
*October 3rd - '''Team Vitality''' parts ways with [[Valmaster]].<ref name="Valmaster leaves">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/1841811323929202692|title=As of today we've decided to part ways with @_Valmaster|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2024-10-03}}</ref>
|content5=
*March 21st - '''Team Vitality''' parts ways with [[Sayff]].<ref name="Sayff leaves">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/1903070524328054974|title=Today we say farewell to Street Fighter and therefore also our player @thesayff|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2025-03-21}}</ref>
*May 13th - '''Team Vitality''' signs [[KingReyJr]].<ref name="VIT KingReyJr">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/1922260705043964220|title=From watching him play, to joining his side|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2025-05-13}}</ref>
*May 14th - '''Team Vitality''' signs [[CientifiKOF]].<ref name="VIT CientifiKOF">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/1922608809983307869|title=Every win Counts - and @CientifiKOF will fight for every single one of them.|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2025-05-14}}</ref>
*October 30th - '''Team Vitality''' sign [[K-TOP]] and [[H-DOPE]].<ref name="VIT K-TOP and H-DOPE">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/1983881960029089836|title=Our fighting game roster just got even stronger 🥊|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2025-10-30}}</ref>
|content6=
*January 24th - '''Team Vitality''' sign [[Neia]].<ref name="VIT Neia">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/2015119470377783560|title=L’avenir de Tekken 8 est entre ses mains : la pépite française rejoint la ruche pour s'emparer du trône !|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2026-01-24}}</ref>
*April 30th - '''Team Vitality''' sign [[Fenritti]].<ref name="Fenritti joins">{{cite web|url=https://x.com/TeamVitality/status/2049928922008002838|title=An EVO Champion who knows how to make every win count|publisher='''Team Vitality'''|date=2026-04-30}}</ref>
}}

