'''VARREL''' is a [[:Category:Japan|Japanese]] esports organization. The team initially known as "'''Unsold Stuff Gaming'''" went through company merger with Japanese video game developer/publisher [https://www.donuts.ne.jp/ Donuts Co. Ltd.] and renamed to "'''Donuts Unsold Stuff Gaming'''". In 2022, The organization was rebranded to "'''VARREL'''".

In April 2024, Topanga merged operations with VARREL and formed a new company called '''"CELLORB"''', with their esports division continuing to use the VARREL brand.

